            "review_title": "Review at Mandala & MA's",
            "review_text": "Vidar66\n35 contributions\n0\nLate lunch with a twist\nJul 2018 • Family\nWe were a group of two families, 11 persons. \nThe place is divided in two. Cofee shop open all day, while the bbq close after lunch and opens at 17. We were not aware of this and arrived around 15. Bbq place was closed, so we walked away to find another place to eat.\nHowever, the coffee shop people had called their boss who tracked us down on his scooter after a few hundred meters..! He invited us back and opened the kitchen. Since it was two hours before normal opening hours some parts was a bit «ad-hoc», due to lack of the usual waiters etc. Fortunately the chef was there and the food that came on the table was first class and delicious.\nA heavy rainstorm made that forced us to quickly change tables did in fact only make the visit even more memorable.\nWell worth the detour.\nThe owner is a Dutch english teacher.\nRead more\nWritten July 6, 2018\nAMM\nThank you for your lovely review. We are glad you enjoyed it.\nWritten August 13, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
