            "review_text": "Lilli_sees_the_world\nVienna, Austria6 contributions\n0\nJust Awesome!\nDec 2017 • Friends\nThe food at Ma's BBQ was a highlight! We ordered a grill, it was so much food, my friends loved it, they are still talking about it. I am vegetarian, so had some troubles to find something BUT they gave me a soup with vegetables and noodles for free, so everybody was satisfied. In the end, they even gave us a dessert (chocolate cake) for free. The hostess of the restaurant was extremely friendly, spoke perfect english and she was well trained in knitting, so she presented me one of her lovely knitted-creatures. Thank you so much!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 7, 2018\nAMM\nThank you so much for your great review! We are happy you enjoyed our restaurant.\nWritten January 14, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
