            "review_title": "Review at Mandala & MA's",
            "review_text": "Andreas K\nOslo, Norway37 contributions\n0\nGreat experience, amazing food and very friendly owners\nJan 2018 • Couples\nWe looked this restaurant up on Tripadvisor, and came just when the bbq-restaurant opened at 17.00. We first walked in to the coffee shop by a mistake (the BBQ is outside). But when the grill was on, and the food was on the table, you just do your own BBQ-ing - and the taste was amazing! After eating the host even invited us inside for extra brilliant tips about sightseeing and things to do in Can Tho. We stayed the hole evening, and tried some of the iced tea, which also was very nice.\n\nMy wife and I will recommend this to everybody visiting Can Tho. Especially if you like BBQ and/or iced tea.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 3, 2018\nAMM\nThank you for the great review. We are happy you enjoyed are food and drink and we hope you had a good time in Can Tho.\nWritten January 5, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
