            "review_title": "Review at Mandala & MA's",
            "review_text": "Victor S\n8 contributions\n0\nA dinner to remember\nJan 2018 • Couples\nWe got noticed right away, the owner talk directly to us and explained the concept. Charcoal was loaded and the BBQ was set. Fresh meat and seafood arrived and the cooking is up to you!\n\nThey were so friendly, the cafe owner (which is next door) told us early on that she baked something for us, so that we would save some space 😁\n\nChilled at the cafe afterwards, didn't want to go back to the hotel. So naturally and friendly people, really a special moment. \n\nSo much recommended!\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2018\nAMM\nThank you for your great review! We are happy you had a good time.\nWritten January 5, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
